01:25:26.600 --> 01:25:29.200
This make a good script for you?


01:25:29.240 --> 01:25:30.160
I know the ending!


01:25:30.200 --> 01:25:32.840
Barbi, go in there
and tell him this is over,


01:25:32.920 --> 01:25:34.440
'cause the cops
are about to get here,


01:25:34.520 --> 01:25:36.520
and when they do,
I'm gonna tell them everything...


01:25:36.600 --> 01:25:38.520
burglary, assault,
extortion.


01:25:38.600 --> 01:25:41.960
I mean, you'll go to Jail for ten years,
with an expensive lawyer.


01:25:42.040 --> 01:25:43.800
So tell me, is this over?


01:25:45.520 --> 01:25:46.960
Correct answer is yes.


01:25:48.640 --> 01:25:49.920
Yes, it's over.


01:25:50.000 --> 01:25:52.120
Okay.


01:25:52.160 --> 01:25:54.320
Go tell this idiot,
before he burns the office down.


01:25:56.000 --> 01:25:57.160
I could've been sitting here!


01:25:57.240 --> 01:25:58.520
No, Jimmy, no!


01:25:58.560 --> 01:25:59.880
- No!
- No, let's go, let's go!


01:25:59.960 --> 01:26:02.360
- We have to burn down his office!
- No! No!


01:26:02.440 --> 01:26:03.440
One problem, dickhead.


01:26:03.520 --> 01:26:07.040
It's not his office,
it's my office, okay?


01:26:57.520 --> 01:26:59.720
You stalking me?


01:27:01.000 --> 01:27:03.040
I am.


01:27:05.240 --> 01:27:07.840
I wanna come home, Jack.


01:27:07.920 --> 01:27:10.800
I wanna come home so bad.


01:27:13.560 --> 01:27:15.600
I Just...


01:27:16.960 --> 01:27:19.280
I Just wanna come home.


01:27:19.360 --> 01:27:24.920
I want us to get it right
and I wanna come home.


01:27:30.600 --> 01:27:31.800
Come here.


01:28:18.280 --> 01:28:19.680
I have made a decision.


01:28:19.720 --> 01:28:22.280
I no longer choose to
be a talent agent.


01:28:22.360 --> 01:28:24.520
I have left my company.


01:28:24.600 --> 01:28:26.640
My former partners all have voted.


01:28:26.720 --> 01:28:29.760
Arlene will replace me
and run the company.


01:28:29.800 --> 01:28:33.120
Needless to say,
this did not sit well with Morty.


01:28:34.720 --> 01:28:37.120
For the first time in fifteen years,


01:28:37.160 --> 01:28:39.960
I will be Just Jack,


01:28:40.040 --> 01:28:43.200
Something I have grown and built
and guided and nourished


01:28:43.240 --> 01:28:48.160
with every beat of life that I had
is no longer mine.


01:28:48.200 --> 01:28:52.040
I am nothing without the elixir
of constant movement.


01:28:52.120 --> 01:28:55.440
I do not know how to Just be still.


01:29:16.200 --> 01:29:17.680
So I shall read these,


01:29:17.760 --> 01:29:19.320
and within two weeks,


01:29:19.400 --> 01:29:22.920
you'll be receiving
a grade and an evaluation.


01:29:22.960 --> 01:29:24.480
Thank you. Thank you.


01:29:24.560 --> 01:29:26.600
I have no problem
with you reading this,


01:29:26.680 --> 01:29:28.080
you and you alone,


01:29:28.160 --> 01:29:29.760
if that's what it takes
to finish the course.


01:29:29.840 --> 01:29:30.720
Wonderful.


01:29:30.800 --> 01:29:32.520
I do not need
an evaluation, however.


01:29:32.600 --> 01:29:35.240
Give me any grade you want.
I'm done.


01:29:35.320 --> 01:29:37.000
I gotta tell you something.


01:29:37.080 --> 01:29:39.600
You're a real shitbag, Primkin.


01:29:45.400 --> 01:29:46.360
All in all, though,


01:29:46.440 --> 01:29:47.560
I think you taught
a pretty good class.


01:29:47.640 --> 01:29:48.840
Thank you.


01:29:50.000 --> 01:29:52.240
So, you're done.
Is that it?


01:29:52.280 --> 01:29:54.360
That's it. I'm done.


01:29:54.440 --> 01:29:56.600
Good. You've done well, son.


01:29:56.680 --> 01:29:58.760
You done good.


01:29:58.840 --> 01:29:59.880
Except...


01:30:01.320 --> 01:30:03.720
you spelled "Primkin" wrong.


01:30:06.800 --> 01:30:08.520
God.


01:30:11.880 --> 01:30:14.520
Nina and I
have a long way to go.


01:30:14.600 --> 01:30:15.960
With the odds against us,


01:30:16.040 --> 01:30:17.880
we are determined
to make it work.


01:30:19.240 --> 01:30:21.320
There's things I'll need to forget.


01:30:23.080 --> 01:30:25.320
There's things she'll need
to make sure I remember.


01:30:29.960 --> 01:30:34.440
How is it possible that I
still have so much to learn?


01:30:36.360 --> 01:30:37.400
End of entry.

